  "description": "<div style=\"font-family: Poppins;\"><div><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size: 14px;font-weight: normal;\">• Brand introduction:</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size: 14px;font-weight: normal;\">Sonic Dental is a UK / US-based brand revolutionizing everyday oral care with advanced, clinic-grade technology made for home use. We’re on a mission to make professional-level dental hygiene accessible, easy, and effective — without the need for complicated routines or expensive treatments.</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size: 14px;font-weight: normal;\"><br>• Product description:</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size: 14px;font-weight: normal;\">The <strong data-start=\"490\" data-end=\"503\" id=\"isPasted\">Sonic Pro</strong> is our hero product — a premium ultrasonic cleaning device designed to clean and sterilise aligners, retainers, mouth guards, and whitening trays using only water. It combines <strong data-start=\"680\" data-end=\"709\">ultrasonic cleaning power</strong> with <strong data-start=\"715\" data-end=\"745\">built-in UVC sterilisation</strong> in a sleek, cordless design. Just fill it with water, place your appliance inside, and press a button — the Sonic Pro does the rest in minutes.</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size: 14px;font-weight: normal;\"><br>• USP (Unique Selling Point):</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size: 14px;font-weight: normal;\">The Sonic Pro offers a <strong data-start=\"959\" data-end=\"1004\" id=\"isPasted\">chemical-free, clinic-grade clean at home</strong> using our <strong data-start=\"1015\" data-end=\"1069\">patent-pending ultrasonic and UVC light technology</strong>. It’s the only product of its kind that both <strong data-start=\"1115\" data-end=\"1156\">cleans and sterilizes with just water</strong>, trusted by over <strong data-start=\"1174\" data-end=\"1195\">100,000 customers</strong> and stocked in <strong data-start=\"1211\" data-end=\"1238\">1,000+ dental practices</strong>.</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size: 14px;font-weight: normal;\"><br>• Payment terms:</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size: 14px;font-weight: normal;\">We offer a <strong data-start=\"1284\" data-end=\"1320\" id=\"isPasted\">competitive commission structure</strong> through our affiliate program, with payments typically made on a <strong data-start=\"1386\" data-end=\"1403\">monthly basis</strong>. Full tracking and reporting are provided via our affiliate dashboard. Custom rates and bonuses are available for high-performing partners.</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size: 14px;font-weight: normal;\"><br>• Other information:</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size: 14px;font-weight: normal;\">We’re looking to collaborate with creators, influencers, and professionals who genuinely care about health, wellness, and smart tech. We support our partners with content, exclusive offers, and first access to new product launches. Our product has been featured across social media and by dental professionals for its performance, design, and simplicity.</p></div></div>",
